data: {"id": "943a4b578e2d4e99-thinking-parallel_evidence-2217", "run_id": "943a4b578e2d4e99", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 本轮调查总结\n\n### 实体身份\n- **Namespace**: `aiops-case-02`\n- **Pod**: `workload-65b7f54794-rnlv4`\n- **UID**: `6d7ef0ba-939d-4371-a7d9-b332d976d782`\n- **Node**: `node2` (10.2.0.50)\n- **Pod IP**: 172.16.104.16\n- **Container**: `app`\n- **Owner**: ReplicaSet `workload-65b7f54794` → Deployment `workload`\n\n### 已采集事实\n\n1. **Pod 当前状态**: `Pending`，Container 状态为 `Waiting`，Reason: `ImagePullBackOff`\n\n2. **核心事件证据（来自 `kubectl_describe` 和 `kubectl_events`）**:\n   - `Failed to pull image \"registry.invalid/aiops/worklo", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1788412910219, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

